# Test Tutor Availability API

### 1. Check if tutor 11 has availability
GET http://localhost:8086/api/tutor-availability/tutor/11
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get available slots for tutor 11
GET http://localhost:8088/api/tutor-availability/tutor/11/available-slots
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create availability for tutor 11 (if needed)
POST http://localhost:8086/api/tutor-availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": 11,
  "tutorName": "Test Tutor",
  "availableDays": ["MONDAY", "WEDNESDAY", "FRIDAY"],
  "timeSlots": [
    {
      "startTime": "10:00",
      "endTime": "12:00"
    },
    {
      "startTime": "14:00",
      "endTime": "16:00"
    }
  ],
  "categories": ["GENERAL_ENGLISH"],
  "levels": ["BEGINNER", "INTERMEDIATE"],
  "hourlyRate": 25.00,
  "maxStudentsCapacity": 10,
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 4. Update availability for tutor 11
PUT http://localhost:8086/api/tutor-availability/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": 11,
  "tutorName": "Test Tutor",
  "availableDays": ["MONDAY", "TUESDAY", "WEDNESDAY", "THURSDAY", "FRIDAY"],
  "timeSlots": [
    {
      "startTime": "09:00",
      "endTime": "11:00"
    },
    {
      "startTime": "13:00",
      "endTime": "15:00"
    },
    {
      "startTime": "16:00",
      "endTime": "18:00"
    }
  ],
  "categories": ["GENERAL_ENGLISH", "BUSINESS_ENGLISH"],
  "levels": ["BEGINNER", "INTERMEDIATE", "ADVANCED"],
  "hourlyRate": 30.00,
  "maxStudentsCapacity": 15,
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}
